out=['# baby-development: pattern 6, The child prefers someone else','','**Written:** 2026-11-20 from baby-development/evidence/2026-11/second-reading/digest-14.md','**Reviewed by the owner:** not yet','','## Limits','','The source is a random, no-keyword sample of 20,000 Reddit posts from twelve parenting subreddits, 1 April–24 October 2026; 2,471 were on-niche, including this pattern’s 129 on-niche posts, with 27 near posts kept apart. Each count is posts tagged by one reader, not people or market prevalence; all 156 supplied posts were read, and cross tags overlap. Forms from different digest readers would be merged by judgement; this pattern has one digest, whose distinct forms are retained.']
for section,items,total in [('On-niche posts',Y,129),('Near posts',N,27),('Across the on-niche posts',A,129)]:
